 ce Cooperation for Investment Advisers and Investment Service Providers
DESCRIPTION:The U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) and the Fren
 ch Autorité des Marchés Financiers (AMF) announced that they have entere
 d into a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) designed to facilitate consulta
 tion and information-sharing in the…\nhttps://www.sec.gov/newsroom/press
